"""
## Purpose and audience
Purpose: Pin Chrome 159's opacity on a page with several opacity:.5 roots that
hold a shadow, an outline, a background + border, and text. Every root
composites as its own group; none of them may lose its opacity.
Audience: browser-engine maintainers.

Chrome 159 (arm64 headless, --force-device-scale-factor=4, 124x24 viewport):
the pins are every non-white pixel whose 4x4 device block is one colour
(1335). The text root's text is the colour of its background, so the pins do
not depend on the font.
"""

"""
Traceability: REQ-BROWSER-ENGINE-MULTI-ROOT-OPACITY-CHROME159-001 — several opacity roots with shadow, outline, border and text keep their opacity as Chrome 159 does.
"""
